# LiVi app icon — основной логотип (2026-10-19)

This is the **canonical app icon**. Do not replace with older glass/EQ/silver variants unless the user explicitly asks.

## Look (locked)

- Background: solid slate `#3E4E62` / RGB `(62, 78, 98)`
- Motif: outline video camera (rounded body + lens trapezoid), **no equalizer bars**
- Stroke: light blue / cyan ≈ RGB `(95, 195, 245)`, slightly thickened inward on the body
- Body height slightly shorter than a perfect square (~10% vertical squash); **lens height unchanged**
- Centered, horizontal, circle-safe scale (~56% width)

## Source / outputs

- Master: `frontend/assets/icon.png` (1024)
- Play Console 512: `frontend/assets/google-play-icon-512.png` (also `icon-512.png`)
- Also synced: `favicon.png`, `adaptive-icon.png`, `adaptive-icon-background.png`, Android `mipmap-*/ic_launcher*`, iOS `App-Icon-1024x1024@1x.png`
- Cam-off / away / PiP logo (transparent): `frontend/assets/away-logo.png` — same blue outline camera
- Entry splash + Metro wait (`SplashLoader` / native): `frontend/assets/splash-icon.png` (+ Android `splashscreen_logo`/`splashscreen_icon`, iOS `SplashScreenLogo`)
- Android system PiP: `frontend/android/.../drawable-nodpi/livi_pip_placeholder.png`
- Raster pipeline source (old EQ motif, for regenerating icon): `frontend/assets/away-logo-source.png`

## When editing

- Prefer regenerating from the away-logo pipeline over redrawing
- Keep interior = background (no EQ, no fill art)
- Sync all launcher/adaptive/iOS assets together
